r his family,the Crandall supporters are just upset that Mr.Lopez did not support him and his B.S.nor did he back down.he also did not mind his name being metioned on this website or public,he does not hide behind &quot;anonymous&quot;.I hope for all the people in Owyhee county that Mr.Lopez keeps his sign up for the 4 years as he said he would.I cannot believe that a sign could get somebody so riled up.So is it the sign that gets to you boys?or is it the fact that Mr.Lopez stood up for himself and his family.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5117120458955402533/comments/default/8446149725235641348'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5117120458955402533/comments/default/8446149725235641348'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/briefly-considered-coda-in-owyhee.html?showComment=1226021940000#c8446149725235641348' title=''/><author><name>owyhee lady</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/briefly-considered-coda-in-owyhee.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5117120458955402533' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5117120458955402533' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 6, 2008 at 6:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2067907571945172105</id><published>2008-11-06T18:24:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-06T18:24:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>YOU NEEDN&#39;T SHOUT, anonymous, especially in light ...</title><content type='html'>YOU NEEDN&#39;T SHOUT, 